419
00:22:55,773 --> 00:23:02,740
Ali, next up is handling the hot snacks by the register.

420
00:23:02,763 --> 00:23:06,829
Yes, like chicken and croquettes.

421
00:23:06,852 --> 00:23:09,019
That’s right.

422
