If a customer asks for chicken, use tongs to put it in a bag.

423
00:23:17,665 --> 00:23:21,282
Got it, I’ll use tongs.

424
00:23:21,305 --> 00:23:27,114
And don’t forget to ask, 'Would you like sauce with that?'

425
00:23:27,137 --> 00:23:30,032
Don’t forget to ask.

426
00:23:30,056 --> 00:23:34,489
Yes, I’ll ask, 'Would you like sauce with that?'

427
00:23:34,512 --> 00:23:36,479
That’s what we ask.

428
00:23:36,502 --> 00:23:41,469
Right now, sauce is free with any chicken purchase.

429
00:23:41,492 --> 00:23:44,466
Yes, it's free.

430
00:23:44,489 --> 00:23:46,522
Got it.

431
00:23:46,545 --> 00:23:52,401
