434
00:24:00,870 --> 00:24:03,204
That machine, right?

435
00:24:03,227 --> 00:24:09,260
Yes, the oil is hot, so please be careful.

436
00:24:09,283 --> 00:24:13,650
Yes, I'll be very careful while working.

437
00:24:13,673 --> 00:24:15,362
Thank you!

438
00:24:15,385 --> 00:24:19,399
Taking care with your work is so important.

439
00:24:19,423 --> 00:24:22,590
Yes, I'll do my best.

440
00:24:22,612 --> 00:24:26,946
Curry bread and croquettes also sell really well.

441
00:24:26,969 --> 00:24:30,302
Curry bread and croquettes, right?

442
00:24:30,325 --> 00:24:32,815
I'll prepare plenty.

443
