When customers order, make sure you don't mix up the items.

444
00:24:38,995 --> 00:24:42,228
Yes, I'll double-check.

445
00:24:42,251 --> 00:24:44,619
It's okay!

446
00:24:44,643 --> 00:24:48,125
Ali, you've already gotten the hang of this, haven't you?

447
00:24:48,148 --> 00:24:51,148
Yes, thank you.

448
00:24:51,171 --> 00:24:54,910
Working with hot snacks is fun.

449
00:24:54,933 --> 00:25:00,029
Now, let's practice frying next.

450
00:25:00,053 --> 00:25:02,819
Yes, please show me.

451
00:25:02,842 --> 00:25:07,289
The oil temperature should be 180 degrees.

452
00:25:07,313 --> 00:25:11,368
Yes, 180 degrees.

453
00:25:11,392 --> 00:25:13,397
I'll remember that.

454
00:25:13,421 --> 00:25:14,921
