459
00:25:35,060 --> 00:25:39,951
Yes, I'll ask, 'Would you like chopsticks?'

460
00:25:39,974 --> 00:25:46,058
For curry or doria, ask if they need a spoon.

461
00:25:46,082 --> 00:25:51,657
Yes, I'll ask, 'Would you like a spoon?'

462
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:53,949
That’s right.

463
00:25:53,973 --> 00:25:59,173
Put one pair of chopsticks in the bento bag.

464
00:25:59,196 --> 00:26:02,648
Yes, I'll put one pair in.

465
