If they say they don't need chopsticks, don't put any in.

473
00:26:34,636 --> 00:26:38,040
Yes, I won't put any in then.

474
00:26:38,064 --> 00:26:42,231
It's easy to forget, so be careful.

475
00:26:42,254 --> 00:26:45,420
Yes, I'll be careful.

476
00:26:45,443 --> 00:26:49,541
It's easy to forget when we're busy.

477
00:26:49,565 --> 00:26:53,498
Yes, I'll calmly put them in the bag.

478
00:26:53,521 --> 00:26:56,460
Great job!

