500
00:28:13,222 --> 00:28:16,831
Bottom shelf—got it.

501
00:28:16,855 --> 00:28:19,989
Drinks go on the top shelf.

502
00:28:20,012 --> 00:28:23,012
Top shelf—yes, I remember.

503
00:28:23,035 --> 00:28:27,269
If there’s a lot of stock, make sure to display plenty.

504
00:28:27,292 --> 00:28:30,773
I’ll arrange them neatly.

505
00:28:30,797 --> 00:28:34,664
