508
00:28:41,133 --> 00:28:43,466
The bread shelves—on it!

509
00:28:43,489 --> 00:28:45,556
I’ll go right away.

510
00:28:45,579 --> 00:28:47,265
Thank you!

511
00:28:47,288 --> 00:28:50,055
You work fast!

512
00:28:50,078 --> 00:28:52,175
Thank you!

513
00:28:52,198 --> 00:28:56,365
It’s a busy time, so please hurry.

514
00:28:56,388 --> 00:28:59,156
I’ll stock them quickly.

515
00:28:59,179 --> 00:29:03,212
Be careful not to let any products fall.

516
00:29:03,235 --> 00:29:06,202
I’ll arrange them carefully.

517
00:29:06,225 --> 00:29:09,358
Stocking shelves is an important job.

518
00:29:09,381 --> 00:29:12,781
I’ll do my best!

519
